# Build outputs from the language fixtures — regenerated by the integration
# tests, never a source of truth.
**/target/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/bin/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# forge-ci's own outputs under a fixture's .forge-ci/. Listed one path
# at a time, never as `**/.forge-ci/`: that directory is primarily *input*
# — artifacts.yml, allowed_signers, allowed_gpg_keys.asc — and a blanket rule
# would silently stop committing a fixture's signer allowlist.
**/.forge-ci/*-build-sbom/
**/.forge-ci/plan.json
**/.forge-ci/release-assembly.json

# Local tool/report droppings
gl-dependency-scanning-report.json
.ci-results/
**/bom.xml
